> [!warning] Two data quirks to fix before any number is trusted
> 1. **`stock_on_hand` units are inconsistent** across notes (some appear to be in `dose_unit`/mg, some in tabs/ml). Forecasts can't be trusted until each note's stock is in a declared, consistent unit.
